  "usage": [
    "Use 深色 to talk about a dark shade or a dark-coloured item. 例如：呢件衫係深色。",
    "It is often used before a noun to describe colour. 例如：我鍾意深色褲。",
    "You can use it when comparing colours with 浅色 / 淺色. 例如：呢隻藍色深色啲。",
    "It sounds natural in everyday shopping, clothes, and design talk. 例如：想要深色嘅枱面。"
  ],
